ocs/changelog-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-2","content":"**修复：Android 安装包权限。** 授予 `REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES` 权限，应用内更新安装 APK 时无需手动授权。"},"181":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-2","content":"**修复：更新徽章与进度条对齐。** 修正应用内更新徽章点击区域与进度条布局。"},"182":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**Bot 配置管理。** Bot 编辑功能已从移动端完全迁移至 Dashboard（`/bots`）。名称、描述、标签、自动回复、头像、模型 — 所有字段集中管理。"},"183":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**模型覆盖字段。** Bot 编辑器新增 `model` 字段，支持按 Bot 覆盖默认模型（留空则使用系统默认）。"},"184":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**活动刷新优化。** 点击刷新不再闪现骨架屏占位块，旧数据保持可见直到新数据加载完成。"},"185":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**主题色彩修复。** Clean Slate 主题下 accent 前景色从近黑色改为白色，在绿色背景上清晰可读。"},"186":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-3","content":"**Bot 列表改为只读。** 设置中移除 Bot 编辑功能，保留名称、头像、标签展示，自动回复状态以胶囊徽章呈现（Auto 实心 / Manual 描边）。"},"187":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-ai-日记归档","content":"**Memo 图片现在会随文本一起发送给 AI。** 每日日记归档现在会将 Memo 图片与文本一同发送。每条 Memo 独立为一条消息，配图内联在对应消息中，AI 能正确关联图片与文本上下文。限制：每条 Memo 最多 2 张图片，每次归档最多 6 张。"},"188":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-ai-日记归档","content":"**超限图片以文字描述提供。** 超出限制的图片会通过 AI 生成文字描述，作为文本上下文附加到对应 Memo，确保没有图片信息被完全丢弃。"},"189":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-ai-日记归档","content":"**持久化图片描述。** 图片上传时即生成 AI 描述并存入 `resources.ai_description` 列。日记归档复用这些已存储的描述，避免重复调用视觉模型。"},"190":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-显示","content":"**高清图片开关。** 设置 → 通用。开启后 Memo 卡片网格和全屏预览直接展示原图，无需缩略图→查看原图的步骤。关闭时保留原有的模糊到清晰渐进加载流程。设置持久化到设备存储。"},"191":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-bot-编辑器","content":"FPS 性能监控"},"192":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-bot-编辑器","content":"描述编辑器"},"193":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-修复","content":"首页和 Bot 编辑器的键盘处理优化"},"194":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-修复","content":"SafeKeyboardProvider 边界情况修复"},"195":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-修复","content":"键盘切换和折叠状态下的掉帧修复"},"196":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化","content":"**修复键盘卡顿** — BotEditorSheet 改用 `KeyboardAwareScrollView`（UI 线程原生动画），消除软键盘弹出/收起时的掉帧卡顿"},"197":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化","content":"升级 `react-native-keyboard-controller` 1.18.5 → 1.21.8 — 带来 layout-free 键盘动画、内存泄漏修复、Fabric 兼容性提升"},"198":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化","content":"FullScreenEditor 从 React Native 内置 `KeyboardAvoidingView` 迁移至 keyboard-controller 原生版本"},"199":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-问题修复","content":"修复归档弹窗关闭后切换日期会意外重新弹出的问题（BottomSheetModal props 变化导致 re-present）"},"200":{"id":"/zh