cs/faq#mosaic-是什么","content":"Mosaic 是一个结合笔记与心情追踪的数字第二大脑应用。它是开源、可自托管的应用，包含移动端（React Native / Expo）和 Rust 后端。"},"369":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#mosaic-免费吗","content":"是的，Mosaic 基于 AGPL-3.0 协议开源，你可以免费自托管。唯一可能的费用是你自己的服务器（VPS、NAS 等）和可选的 AI API 使用费。"},"370":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#需要服务器吗","content":"是的，Mosaic 需要服务器来存储数据、同步和使用 AI 功能。你可以将其部署在任何支持 Docker 的机器上——一台便宜的 VPS 就足够了。"},"371":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#如何开始使用","content":"用 Docker Compose 部署服务端（参见快速开始）"},"372":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#如何开始使用","content":"安装移动端 APK"},"373":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#如何开始使用","content":"在移动应用中连接你的服务器地址"},"374":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#需要-ai-api-密钥吗","content":"AI 功能（自动标签、自动摘要、机器人回复）是可选的。你需要在管理面板中配置 AI 提供者（兼容 OpenAI 或 Anthropic）。不配置 AI 时，所有核心功能正常工作。"},"375":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#服务器最低配置","content":"1 CPU 核心，512MB 内存，10GB 存储"},"376":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#服务器最低配置","content":"Docker 和 Docker Compose"},"377":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#服务器最低配置","content":"支持 PostgreSQL 的环境（pgvector 扩展通过 Docker 自动安装）"},"378":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#数据存储在哪里","content":"在你的自己的服务器上。所有数据（笔记、图片、视频）都保存在你控制的硬件上。存储可以是本地磁盘或 Cloudflare R2（兼容 S3）。"},"379":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#能导出数据吗","content":"API 支持通过标准 REST 端点获取所有笔记、日记和资源。管理面板也提供健康和统计信息。"},"380":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#数据加密吗","content":"**传输中**：是的，通过反向代理配置 HTTPS 后加密（参见部署指南）"},"381":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#数据加密吗","content":"**静态存储**：数据库级别加密取决于你的 PostgreSQL 配置。文件存储按原样保存在磁盘或 R2 上"},"382":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#数据加密吗","content":"**密码**：使用 bcrypt 哈希存储"},"383":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#mosaic-支持多用户吗","content":"目前 Mosaic 主要面向个人或小团队使用。多个用户共享同一个服务器实例。"},"384":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#可以离线使用吗","content":"移动端使用 SQLite 在本地缓存数据。你可以在离线时查看和编辑笔记——重新连接服务器后会自动同步。"},"385":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#支持哪些-ai-模型","content":"任何兼容 OpenAI API 或 Anthropic API 的模型。包括 OpenAI（GPT-4、GPT-4o）、Anthropic（Claude）、Ollama（本地）以及提供兼容端点的任何服务商。"},"386":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#同步如何工作","content":"Mosaic 使用基于时间戳的游标协议。每种实体类型（笔记、日记、资源、机器人）跟踪其最后更新时间。移动端客户端从上次同步游标处拉取变更并在本地合并。"},"387":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#冲突怎么办","content":"Mosaic 采用\"最后写入者胜出\"策略，基于 `updated_at` 时间戳。保留最近的更改。"},"388":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#服务器无法启动","content":"检查 PostgreSQL 是否运行且可访问"},"389":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#服务器无法启动","content":"验证 `DATABASE_URL` 是否正确"},"390":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#服务器无法启动","content":"确保端口未被占用（默认：8080）"},"391":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/faq#服务器无法启动","content":"查看服务器日志：`docker compose logs mosaic-server`"},"392":{"id":"/zh/docs/faq-48","page_id":"/z